title: "Symnoesis (SYMN-01): Measuring Long-Term Human-AI Interaction"
abstract: "An open specification and toolkit for measuring the quality, safety, and cognitive impact of long-term human-AI interaction by treating human and machine as one unit, the Dyadic State."
authors:
  - name: "HarVa Groups"
